# Public client configuration. Copy this file to .env for local development.
# VITE_ values are compiled into the browser bundle; never add a secret.
#
#
# The local platform service (services/platform-api, #508) is the IdP every
# zone reads its session from (owner decision 2026-10-29: local-only).
# VITE_PLATFORM_URL / VITE_PLATFORM_ANON_KEY default to http://127.0.0.1:8400
# and a placeholder key (src/lib/session.ts), matching the Shell. VITE_API_URL
# is optional: unset, it defaults to "/life/api".
VITE_PLATFORM_URL=
VITE_PLATFORM_ANON_KEY=
VITE_API_URL=
